  <h2>Optimizing Your Working Capital</h2>
  <p>Dead stock is the enemy of growth. Fitclo's <strong>Inventory Management</strong> systems help global brands maintain a lean supply chain without risking stockouts on core best-sellers.</p>
  
  <h3>The Just-in-Time (JIT) Model for B2B</h3>
  <p>We leverage our 450,000 monthly capacity to offer JIT production schedules for our long-term partners. By keeping smaller, frequent production runs (batches), you can respond to market trends in real-time while keeping your warehouse costs low.</p>
  
  <h3>Digital Tracking & Transparency</h3>
  <p>As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we provide real-time updates on your production status. Knowing exactly when a batch finishes QC allows your <strong>Global Logistics</strong> team to pre-book shipping containers, saving up to 10% on freight costs.</p>

  <h3>Strategic Safety Stock</h3>
  <p>We offer dedicated warehouse space in Guangzhou and Yiwu for our enterprise clients to hold "Safety Stock" of finished goods or raw materials, ensuring that even during peak seasons like Black Friday, your brand never goes dark.</p>
